  "ruleText": "Ncr 553.04 Failure to Comply. Violations of a designated quarantine shall be penalized pursuant to RSA 227-K:2, IV and RSA 227-K:17.\n\nSource. #14243, INTERIM, eff 4-23-25; ss by #14452 (formerly Ncr 5503.04), eff 12-6-25, EXPIRES 12-6-35",
